    "body": "Not a blocker but if possible can you use the `exec_cmd` here since it will also provide some additional logging and automatically kill the command if it takes too long e.g\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\nfn execute_rustup_default(context: &Context) -> Option<String> {\r\n    context\r\n        .exec_cmd(\"rustup\", &[\"default\"])?\r\n        .stdout\r\n        .split_whitespace()\r\n        .next()\r\n        .map(str::to_owned)\r\n}\r\n```",
